---
import {Button} from 'astro-pure/user'
---
<section
  class='not-prose mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl border bg-card/30 p-4 sm:p-5'
  aria-label='AI Bot'
>
  <div class='flex items-start gap-3'>
    <div
      class='flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border bg-muted text-primary'
      aria-hidden='true'
    >
      <svg
        xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
        width='22'
        height='22'
        viewBox='0 0 24 24'
        fill='none'
        stroke='currentColor'
        stroke-width='1.8'
        stroke-linecap='round'
        stroke-linejoin='round'
      >
        <path d='M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z' />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class='flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-1'>
      <h2 id='ai-bot' class='text-lg font-medium'>AI Bot</h2>
      <p class='text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground'>
        本站提供 AI 辅助支持：如果对某篇文章有疑惑，想深入了解某些细节，或者想反馈建议，都可以去问我的 AI Bot。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class='text-xs leading-5 text-muted-foreground/80'>
    反馈时留下你的邮箱，AI 会自动整理问题并向我报告，我稍后会通过邮箱回信给你。
  </p>
  <div class='flex justify-end'>
    <Button
      as='a'
      title='去问问我的 AI Bot'
      href='https://qm.qq.com/q/QegqadxjCS'
      target='_blank'
      rel='noopener'
      variant='ahead'
    />
  </div>
</section>
